"# Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"This file lists the maintainers of the project. For information on how to contribute, please refer to CONTRIBUTING.md.\n"
"\n"
"## Current Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"| Name | GitHub ID | Affiliation | Role |\n"
"|------|-----------|-------------|------|\n"
"| Zhang San | zhangsan | Example Corp | Maintainer |\n"
"| Li Si | lisi | Example Inc | Maintainer |\n"
"\n"
"## Emeritus Maintainers\n"
"\n"
"| Name | GitHub ID | Affiliation | Role |\n"
"|------|-----------|-------------|------|\n"
"| Wang Wu | wangwu | Example Ltd | Emeritus Maintainer |\n"
"\n"
"## Responsibilities\n"
"\n"
"- Review and merge pull requests\n"
"- Triage and respond to issues\n"
"- Maintain project roadmap and release cycles\n"
"- Ensure code quality and adherence to project standards\n"
"- Guide and mentor new contributors\n"
"\n"
"## Governance\n"
"\n"
"This project follows the [CNCF Governance Guidelines](https://github.com/cncf/foundation/blob/main/GOVERNANCE.md). All maintainers are expected to adhere to the [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).\n"

